	column Attribute_EN = ```
			
			SWITCH(
			    TRUE(),
			    'summary'[attribut] = "Reco.",                 "Predicted",
			    'summary'[attribut] = "Réel",                  "Real",
			    'summary'[attribut] = "Ecart reco. - réel",    "Gap Predicted – Real",
			    'summary'[attribut] = "Target IA min",         "AI min target",
			    'summary'[attribut] = "Target IA max",         "AI max target",
			    'summary'[attribut]                           -- valeur par défaut (on garde tel quel)
			)
			
			```
		lineageTag: 15eaa0a1-0370-4f57-a758-fc14c1700109
